'' 'public #include' (tiko-vendor RFC-0002 V1, V12): the module vp/geo is nothing but a
'' header it carries publicly, and the importer names its type, macro and const bare. The
'' header tests VP_MODE, which only the module has (its package's [defines]): the
'' interface defines it around the header for the importer, then undefines it again.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i tests/modules/src/vpub/libs tests/modules/src/vpub/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/vendorpub.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/vendorpub.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  7              42            7
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: VP_MODE scoped
